        </a>

           <a href="chat_siwoo.html" class="chat-item">
            <div class="profile-img" style="background-image: url('basic.jpg');"></div>
            <div class="chat-text">
                <div class="chat-name">개새끼</div>
                <div class="chat-preview">지랄 좀 그만 하고 살아 지랄하려고 태어났어?</div>
            </div>
            <div class="chat-meta">
                <div class="chat-time">오전 6:45</div>
            </div>
        </a>

           <a href="chat_man.html" class="chat-item">
            <div class="profile-img" style="background-image: url('basic.jpg');"></div>
            <div class="chat-text">
                <div class="chat-name">매니저형님</div>
                <div class="chat-preview">민식아 제발 그렇게 살지 좀 마라</div>
